<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<xmi:XMI xmlns:uml="http://schema.omg.org/spec/UML/2.1" xmlns:xmi="http://schema.omg.org/spec/XMI/2.1" xmi:version="2.1">
  <xmi:Documentation exporter="Enterprise Architect" exporterVersion="6.5" exporterID="1721" />
  <uml:Model xmi:type="uml:Model" xmi:id="EAID_94C85D42_C98D_5523_8CA4_23F52782172C" name="EA_Model" visibility="public">
    <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="EAPK_08554EBD_AAF6_50CC_8A26_3C2358F64360" name="Luoc do 3.10 - Use case quan ly hoa hong doi soat va chi tra" visibility="public">
      <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_E95210FD_0440_518F_A53D_2CFE984EF715">
        <body>Nguon: BAOCAO.md muc3.1-3.4; SPEC.md muc6.11. Day la goi doc lap de nhap vao Sparx Enterprise Architect.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Actor" xmi:id="EAID_8D356148_4F2C_5228_A67B_2909B6604E60" name="Quan tri nen tang" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_27E4B19E_4C63_5DBA_BBE7_F04C097536F6">
          <body>Nguon: BAOCAO.md muc3.1; SPEC.md muc4.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_EB8FBD73_DEFB_5978_A377_3F400E19D7C5" name="Thiet lap chinh sach hoa hong va phi" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_A85E9075_F713_55AF_AD31_E133BAEB9C4F">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.31: Cho phep quan tri tao chinh sach hoa hong theo to chuc voi ty le, phi co dinh va thoi gian hieu luc.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc6.11.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_76DA2C68_5CDE_5916_BD36_F04C574CF984" name="Lap va tinh lai doi soat su kien" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_B71BC1AD_1ECA_55B4_AC89_A455E59FEC18">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.32: Quan tri lap/toi da mot Settlement moi Event, chi recalculate khi DRAFT; grossRevenue/totalRefund/totalCommission la snapshot tinh tung Order hop le, loai thu/hoan bu tru. SettlementOrderSnapshot la du lieu ky thuat theo don; Event khong co don hop le chi hien bao cao 0.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc6.11.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_B67C235B_F903_586A_949E_C6467428F680" name="Xac nhan doi soat su kien" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_61B6A8B9_CDE2_5373_B187_E5300775668E">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.33: Quan tri confirm Settlement sau endTime ke ca Event huy, khong con Payment/Refund/cac cong viec chua xu ly hoac UNKNOWN; tinh lai cung giao dich roi dong bang tong va SettlementOrderSnapshot. netPayable = 0 hoan tat khong tao lan chi gia.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc6.11.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_98705FD9_496C_5088_A2AB_E785996E95D3" name="Ghi nhan chi tra mo phong cho to chuc" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_4EB2C1B1_39C4_5A46_8814_69BFF8B60F53">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.34: Settlement.beginPayout/recordPayoutResult quan ly paidAmount/pendingAmount voi payoutId on dinh; paid + pending khong vuot netPayable. SUCCEEDED tang paid, FAILED giai phong pending; PAID chi khi paid = net va pending = 0. SettlementTransferLog la lich su ky thuat, khong co class Payout nghiep vu.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc6.11.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Association" xmi:id="EAID_4FAE77CA_4ED2_5C6A_A6E1_69170F779948" visibility="public">
